class BlenderPilotAdapterProductionTests{
 static int n;static void C(bool b,string m){n++;if(!b)throw new Exception(m);}static GameObject Child(GameObject root,string name){var g=new GameObject(name);g.transform.SetParent(root.transform);return g;}
 static GameObject Asset(string omit=null){var g=new GameObject("Vanguard");g.AddComponent<Animator>();var inactive=Child(g,"inactive animation");inactive.SetActive(false);inactive.AddComponent<Animation>();g.AddComponent<Renderer>().sharedMaterial=new Material();g.AddComponent<MeshFilter>().sharedMesh=new Mesh();LayerFixture.Build(g,omit);return g;}
 static void Ready(string omit=null){Resources.Items.Clear();Resources.Items["BlenderPilot/Vanguard"]=Asset(omit);Resources.Items["BlenderPilot/Pilot_Atlas_Standard"]=new Material();Resources.Clips=new[]{"Pilot_Idle","Pilot_Move","Pilot_Basic","Pilot_Hit","Pilot_Skill"}.Select(x=>new AnimationClip{name=x,length=2}).ToArray();}
 static CombatModel Model(){var root=new GameObject("model");var model=root.AddComponent<CombatModel>();model.heroClass=HeroClass.Vanguard;Child(root,"visible old").AddComponent<Renderer>().enabled=true;Child(root,"hidden old").AddComponent<Renderer>().enabled=false;model.swordRig=Child(root,"procedural sword").transform;model.swordRig.localPosition=new Vector3(-10,0,0);model.isolatedPreview=true;model.Init();model.isolatedPreview=false;return model;}
 static void RendererMembership(){
  Ready();BlenderPilotArt.Enabled=true;var m=Model();m.Sample();var cache=(RendererGroupCache)typeof(CombatModel).GetField("pilotRendererGroup",BindingFlags.Instance|BindingFlags.NonPublic).GetValue(m);int revision=cache.Revision;
  for(int i=0;i<20;i++)m.Sample();C(cache.Revision==revision,"stable pilot samples reuse renderer membership without scans");
  var added=Child(m.gameObject,"late nested group");var visible=Child(added,"visible").AddComponent<Renderer>();var hidden=Child(added,"hidden").AddComponent<Renderer>();hidden.enabled=false;m.Sample();C(!visible.enabled&&!hidden.enabled&&cache.Revision>revision,"added nested renderer group is hidden on next production sample");
  var detached=new GameObject("outside");added.transform.SetParent(detached.transform);m.Sample();C(visible.enabled&&!hidden.enabled,"reparented renderers restore their original mixed visibility");
  added.transform.SetParent(m.gameObject.transform);m.Sample();C(!visible.enabled,"reparented group reenters hidden ownership");
  var sharedPreviewCache=new RendererGroupCache(m.transform);sharedPreviewCache.Read();var replacement=added.AddComponent<Renderer>();m.ApplyEquipment(null,null,null);m.Sample();C(!replacement.enabled,"actual equipment path invalidates component-only replacement renderer");C(sharedPreviewCache.Dirty,"actual equipment replacement invalidates other display cache owners");sharedPreviewCache.Dispose();
  added.Components.Remove(replacement);m.ApplyEquipment(null,null,null);m.Sample();C(replacement.enabled,"removed renderer releases owned hidden state");
  UnityEngine.Object.Destroy(added);m.Sample();C(m.Visible,"deleted hierarchy refresh does not interrupt supported pilot");
  m.Unsupported("airborne");m.Sample();C(m.GetComponentsInChildren<Renderer>(true).Where(x=>x.gameObject.name=="visible old").Single().enabled,"fallback still restores original group after repeated structural changes");UnityEngine.Object.Destroy(m.gameObject);UnityEngine.Object.Destroy(detached);
 }
 static void RendererCacheRelease(){
  Ready();BlenderPilotArt.Enabled=true;var m=Model();m.Sample();
  var flags=BindingFlags.Instance|BindingFlags.NonPublic;var cache=(RendererGroupCache)typeof(CombatModel).GetField("pilotRendererGroup",flags).GetValue(m);
  var survivor=Child(m.gameObject,"surviving detached group");var shown=Child(survivor,"originally shown").AddComponent<Renderer>();var hidden=Child(survivor,"originally hidden").AddComponent<Renderer>();hidden.enabled=false;m.Sample();
  var localCache=new RendererGroupCache(survivor.transform);localCache.Read();
  survivor.transform.SetParent(null); // Do not call model.Sample or cache.Read before owner destruction.
  foreach(var observer in survivor.GetComponentsInChildren<RendererGroupObserver>(true))
  {var owners=(List<RendererGroupCache>)typeof(RendererGroupObserver).GetField("owners",flags).GetValue(observer);C(owners.Count==1&&ReferenceEquals(owners[0],localCache),"detached subtree immediately drops old cache but keeps its own live cache");}
  UnityEngine.Object.Destroy(m.gameObject);
  C(shown.enabled&&!hidden.enabled,"model destruction restores detached hidden renderer states without another sample");
  C(typeof(CombatModel).GetField("pilotRendererGroup",flags).GetValue(m)==null&&typeof(RendererGroupCache).GetField("root",flags).GetValue(cache)==null,"actual OnDestroy clears model and cache root references");
  C(((Renderer[])typeof(RendererGroupCache).GetField("renderers",flags).GetValue(cache)).Length==0&&((List<RendererGroupObserver>)typeof(RendererGroupCache).GetField("observers",flags).GetValue(cache)).Count==0,"actual OnDestroy clears cached membership and observer list");
  typeof(CombatModel).GetMethod("ReleasePilotRendererGroup",flags).Invoke(m,null);localCache.Dispose();
  C(survivor.GetComponentsInChildren<RendererGroupObserver>(true).All(o=>((List<RendererGroupCache>)typeof(RendererGroupObserver).GetField("owners",flags).GetValue(o)).Count==0),"idempotent owner teardown and local dispose leave no observer subscription");
  UnityEngine.Object.Destroy(survivor);
 }
 static void Main(){
 C(!BlenderPilotArt.Enabled,"pilot disabled on fresh startup");Ready();int loads=Resources.Loads;C(BlenderPilotVisual.Create(null)==null&&Resources.Loads==loads,"disabled pilot never loads assets");
 BlenderPilotArt.Enabled=true;Resources.Items.Clear();C(BlenderPilotVisual.Create(null)==null,"missing model falls back");
 foreach(var socket in new[]{"Anchor_Pommel","Anchor_Grip","Anchor_Guard","Anchor_BladeRoot","Anchor_Tip"}){Ready(socket);C(BlenderPilotVisual.Create(null)==null,"each missing socket falls back");C(!GameObject.All.Any(g=>g.name=="Blender pilot visual (sampled skeleton)"&&!g.destroyed),"missing socket destroys incomplete imported instance");}
 foreach(var clip in new[]{"Pilot_Idle","Pilot_Move","Pilot_Basic","Pilot_Hit","Pilot_Skill"}){Ready();Resources.Clips=Resources.Clips.Where(x=>x.name!=clip).ToArray();C(BlenderPilotVisual.Create(null)==null,"each missing clip falls back");C(!GameObject.All.Any(g=>g.name=="Blender pilot visual (sampled skeleton)"&&!g.destroyed),"missing clip destroys incomplete imported instance");}
 BlenderPilotArt.Enabled=true;typeof(BlenderPilotArt).GetMethod("ResetForPlayerStartup",BindingFlags.Static|BindingFlags.NonPublic).Invoke(null,null);C(!BlenderPilotArt.Enabled,"subsystem startup resets stale opt-in without domain reload");BlenderPilotArt.Enabled=true;Ready();var m=Model();C(m.View!=null&&m.View.Ready,"complete imported asset configures");C(!m.View.gameObject.activeSelf,"imported root stays hidden until first sample");C(m.View.GetComponentsInChildren<Animator>(true).All(a=>!a.enabled&&!a.applyRootMotion)&&m.View.GetComponentsInChildren<Animation>(true).All(a=>!a.enabled&&!a.playAutomatically),"manual sampler disables all automatic drivers including inactive descendants");
 var old=m.GetComponentsInChildren<Renderer>(true).Where(x=>!x.transform.IsChildOf(m.View.transform)).ToArray();C(m.Sample()&&old.All(x=>!x.enabled),"supported pilot hides procedural renderers");
 for(int swing=0;swing<4;swing++){m.swingCount=swing;C(m.WeaponSwingSide==-1,"authored external sword keeps fixed sampled swing side");}
 foreach(float interval in new[]{.18f,.46f,.9f}){Time.frameCount++;int before=AnimationClip.Samples;m.PlayAction(-1,true,interval);C(AnimationClip.Samples==before+3&&AnimationClip.Last.name=="Pilot_Basic"&&Math.Abs(AnimationClip.At/AnimationClip.Last.length-.52f)<.0001f,"actual PlayAction commit samples contact .52 without hidden windup");C(m.TryGetWeaponVisualAnchor(WeaponVisualAnchor.SwordTip,out var anchor)&&LayerFixture.Near(anchor,m.View.GetComponentsInChildren<Transform>(true).Single(x=>x.name=="Anchor_Tip").position),"ribbon anchor reads the sampled external tip");}
 m.PlayAction(7,false);C(AnimationClip.Last.name=="Pilot_Skill","representative skill commit selects imported skill clip");m.locomotion.Speed=1;m.locomotion.Phase=(float)Math.PI;m.Sample();C(AnimationClip.Last.name=="Pilot_Move"&&Math.Abs(AnimationClip.At-1)<.0001f,"movement bridge samples phase through actual imported clip length");m.locomotion.Speed=0;Time.time=2;m.Sample(false,0,true);C(AnimationClip.Last.name=="Pilot_Hit","hurt edge selects imported hit clip");Time.time=2.3f;m.Sample(false,0,false);C(LayerFixture.MatchesClip(m.View.gameObject,"Pilot_Idle",.15f),"hurt clip expires into idle");
 foreach(string reason in new[]{"gear","fashion","airborne","charge","death","landing","strafe","backwards","skill"}){m.Unsupported(reason);m.actionBasic=false;m.actionSkill=reason=="skill"?2:7;C(!m.Sample(reason=="skill",.52f),"unsupported states use procedural fallback");C(!m.View.gameObject.activeSelf&&old[0].enabled&&!old[1].enabled,"fallback restores each original renderer enabled state");C(m.TryGetWeaponVisualAnchor(WeaponVisualAnchor.SwordTip,out var a)&&a.x==-10,"hidden pilot does not supply sword anchors");m.Unsupported("");C(m.Sample(),"supported state re-enters pilot");}
 BlenderPilotArt.Enabled=false;C(!m.Sample()&&old[0].enabled&&!old[1].enabled,"runtime opt-out restores originals");for(int swing=0;swing<4;swing++){m.swingCount=swing;C(m.WeaponSwingSide==(swing%2==0?1:-1),"procedural fallback preserves alternating swing side");}BlenderPilotArt.Enabled=true;m.Sample();
 var mesh=m.View.GetComponentsInChildren<MeshFilter>(true)[0].sharedMesh;var material=m.View.GetComponentsInChildren<Renderer>(true)[0].sharedMaterial;C(object.ReferenceEquals(mesh,Resources.Load<GameObject>("BlenderPilot/Vanguard").GetComponentsInChildren<MeshFilter>(true)[0].sharedMesh),"imported mesh remains shared");UnityEngine.Object.Destroy(m.gameObject);C(!mesh.destroyed&&!material.destroyed,"destroying model never owns or destroys imported shared assets");
 Ready();var preview=Model();preview.isolatedPreview=true;preview.previewTime=.5f;Time.time=50;preview.Sample();float t=AnimationClip.At;Time.time=500;preview.Sample();C(LayerFixture.MatchesClip(preview.View.gameObject,"Pilot_Idle",.25f),"isolated idle final pose uses preview clock");Time.time=501;preview.Sample(false,0,true);C(LayerFixture.MatchesClip(preview.View.gameObject,"Pilot_Idle",.25f),"isolated preview does not sample wall-clock hit reaction");
 preview.actionSkill=-3;preview.actionDuration=0;preview.Tick(0);C(!preview.Visible,"isolated short move restores visible procedural pose instead of frozen pilot idle");preview.actionSkill=0;preview.Tick(0);C(preview.Visible,"ending short move restores imported idle preview");
 Ready();var equipped=Model();equipped.Sample();var baseBlade=Child(equipped.swordRig.gameObject,"Forged Sword").AddComponent<Renderer>();baseBlade.enabled=true;
 var starter=new ItemData{id="starter",name="初行长剑",slot=ItemSlot.Weapon,rarity=Rarity.Common,level=1};
 equipped.ApplyEquipment(starter,null,null);C(equipped.Visible&&!baseBlade.enabled&&equipped.GetComponentsInChildren<Renderer>(true).Where(x=>!x.transform.IsChildOf(equipped.View.transform)&&x.gameObject.activeInHierarchy).All(x=>!x.enabled),"actual supported equipment rebuild hides new procedural renderers");
 equipped.ApplyEquipment(null,null,null);C(equipped.Visible&&!baseBlade.enabled,"actual null equipment refresh cannot re-enable base blade beside pilot");equipped.Unsupported("airborne");equipped.Sample();C(baseBlade.enabled,"fallback restores refreshed null-equipment base visibility");equipped.Unsupported("");equipped.Sample();
 equipped.locomotion.Speed=1;equipped.PlayAction(-1,true,.46f);C(equipped.Visible&&!baseBlade.enabled,"actual moving basic stays on imported layered rig");equipped.Sample(false);equipped.PlayAction(7,false);C(!equipped.Visible,"actual moving skill commit falls back instead of fullbody foot sliding");equipped.locomotion.Speed=0;equipped.PlayAction(-1,true,.46f);C(equipped.Visible,"stationary action restores supported sampled pilot");
 var player=new GameObject("live player").AddComponent<PlayerController>();player.model=equipped;player.TakeDamageFrom(10000,"lethal test");C(player.IsDead&&player.session.Deaths==1&&!equipped.Visible&&!equipped.View.gameObject.activeSelf&&baseBlade.enabled,"actual player lethal damage restores procedural death presentation immediately");C(!equipped.Sample(),"dead model cannot re-enter pilot without further player updates");player.RefreshStats(false);C(!equipped.Sample(),"nonhealing stat refresh cannot revive dead pilot");player.RefreshStats(true);C(!player.IsDead&&equipped.Sample()&&equipped.Visible,"actual healing stat refresh allows reused respawn model to sample again");
 LayerFixture.Run();
 var combat=new GameObject("combat only").AddComponent<CombatModel>();combat.heroClass=HeroClass.Vanguard;combat.Init();C(combat.View==null&&!combat.Sample(),"combat never switches incomplete whole-body pilot");
 BlenderPilotReadinessTests.Run();
 RendererMembership();
 RendererCacheRelease();
 Console.WriteLine("PASS: "+n+" production Blender adapter/create/sampler/commit/anchor/fallback/ownership checks (managed Unity boundaries)");
 }
